{meta title='The prefix says which is meant', about='A data store named upper: bare, {upper} is the store, as the stores come before the functions - and the function is reached as function:upper.'/}
{data 'upper'}["a", "b"]{/data}
<p>{upper}{$upper} {/upper}</p>
<p>{function:upper}the function{/function:upper}</p>
